<title>UK: Sony Capital sets 25 bln yen dual-currency bond.</title>
<headline>Sony Capital sets 25 bln yen dual-currency bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch (Japan).</p>
<p> BORROWER   SONY CAPITAL CORP</p>
<p> KEEPWELL AGREEMENT WITH SONY CORP</p>
<p> AMT    25 BLN YEN    COUPON   **5.01	MATURITY    31.JUL.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    31.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.5	 LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> NOTES   ** COUPON IN YEN, REDEMPTION AT $4363.38 PER 5000 YEN</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA3/AA    DENOMS (K) 500	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
